odoba się władczyni, która - po nieudanej próbie przejęcia przez niego tronu - wtrąca go do więzienia w Tower","popularity":1.5287,"poster_path":"/b0rK1LNAmyaEGbdJ8kvGzU3QVe6.jpg","release_date":"1939-11-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.3,"vote_count":99,"credit_id":"52fe46f59251416c750893a5","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/gVCUB5cYjZVzNyBS46Q6RXLfmSr.jpg","genre_ids":[12,36,10749],"id":16905,"title":"Kapitan Blood","original_language":"en","original_title":"Captain Blood","overview":"Doktor Peter Blood zostaje skazany na śmierć za udzielenie pomocy rannemu rebeliantowi. Wyrok nie zostaje wykonany, a lekarz trafia do niewoli. Los rzuca go na morze, gdzie na hiszpańskim statku staje na czele grupy niewolników.","popularity":2.4066,"poster_path":"/aCyHg3ZEREadj9cQ3FbT0j8YLFK.jpg","release_date":"1935-12-26","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.2,"vote_count":274,"credit_id":"52fe46f59251416c75089439","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/hdmy4qQhVP008GWLKsJXtevgExo.jpg","genre_ids":[18,53,9648],"id":46434,"title":"The Man in the Net","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Man in the Net","overview":"","popularity":1.1485,"poster_path":"/sdJlxL96ZIOi9oB7Uq35cp9mlGI.jpg","release_date":"1959-06-10","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.158,"vote_count":19,"credit_id":"52fe46f6c3a36847f811c321","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/dsrHhe5Ljve2WKwDUHJPIfyG3f1.jpg","genre_ids":[18,12,10752],"id":43884,"title":"The Charge of the Light Brigade","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Charge of the Light Brigade","overview":"","popularity":2.2909,"poster_path":"/v7PFjyhEAWKGQ8g6cTGw4GzYKsa.jpg","release_date":"1936-10-20","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":84,"credit_id":"52fe4668c3a36847f80fd50b","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/dNB